		{
			dependencies: ["534239273A7CA7FC"]
			description: [
				"No fuel burns here, but the ground itself is a furnace. A hot plate on it and a tall radiator up towards the clouds run the &6Venus Heat Engine&r on a little distilled water, and it's always noon on Venus."
