		{
			dependencies: ["1FC3B4F64BD93361"]
			description: [
				"GT--'s activator only makes naquadah while its neutron energy sits in a narrow window, and outside it you get radioactive waste. The &6Naquadah Plant&r holds the window with a Pu-Be source from the hot cell's circuit 2 and makes its superacid inside."
				"Two EV energy hatches run it until Mercury's iridium brings IV ones."
