		{
			dependencies: ["1D2410B18346F998"]
			description: ["Naquadah only melts in a blast furnace with HSS-G coils, and the hot ingot wants the Moon's liquid helium in the vacuum freezer. The &6Naquadah Ingot&r is where the doped boule, the wafers and LuV's UHPIC chips start."]
