			dependencies: ["5FEF4C258358DCEE"]
			description: [
				"Eight heliostat mirrors around a focal furnace, on a pad of smelted Mercury rock. When a run starts with the sun on the receiver and every mirror under open sky, the &6Mercury Solar Works&r pays a quarter of the power."
