		{
			dependencies: ["147AC69C089D11C2", "1F70EF41E5F8ED95"]
			description: [
				"The ore plant turns raw iridosmine into dust, and the platinum plant on circuit 3 runs GregTech's whole chain inside: &6Iridium&r and &6Osmium&r come out, three to one. Earth's platinum doesn't give either any more."
				"Iridium is what IV energy and dynamo hatches were waiting for, and osmium only melts at LuV voltage, so two IV hatches it is."
