		{
			dependencies: ["72E1760292CBF88F"]
			description: [
				"The &6Assembly Line&r builds what no single machine can, and its tiny input buses are read in order, one ingredient each. Its casings want IV sensors, emitters and ruridit gears, so it waits for iridium."
